# Line endings are platform-independent in this repo.
#
# Why: this tree is worked from both Windows (git.exe, which reads
# core.autocrlf=true from C:/Program Files/Git/etc/gitconfig) and WSL (whose
# git never reads that system config, so it stages CRLF verbatim). In the
# Research repo on 2026-09-05 that produced 103 files staged as whole-file
# rewrites -- 620,502 lines added and 620,502 removed, zero content change.
# text=auto stores LF in the repo regardless of which git commits.
* text=auto

# Binary: never convert, never diff as text.
*.pkl  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
